* 2D mode 2 with token 2 = 1: interference area = 1 percent of the reference area, die 2 ends slightly deeper than in ifd_m2_2d
* ORACLE: 'Object 2 is interference positioned w.r.t. Object 1.', die 2 displacement (1.57e-15, -12.8415477900) (net -2.84155 after the lift). Independent area calculation from the SPIKE geometry (ref area 25.4 x 57.15, Atol = 14.516) gives -12.839: agrees within the 1e-3 relative area tolerance.
KFREAD 0
SPIKE_SI.KEY
OBJPOS 2 1 0 10
OBJPOS 2 2 1.0 1 0 -1 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
